msgid ""
"This tag is useful for generating interacting atoms in low dimensional "
"systems. When ``PERIODIC[i]`` is zero, periodic boundary condition is "
"turned off along the direction of the lattice vector "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{a}_{i}`."
msgstr ""

