#: ../../source/almdir/inputalm.rst:317
msgid ""
"FC_ZERO_THR-tag : Threshold value used when trimming force constants when"
" creating PREFIX.xml"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/inputalm.rst:319
msgid "1.0e-12"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/inputalm.rst:321
msgid ""
"``FC_ZERO_THR`` defines the threshold of force constants to be saved in "
"an XML file. If the absolute value of a force constant is smaller than "
"``FC_ZERO_THR``, it will NOT be printed out."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/almdir/inputalm.rst:324
msgid ""
"If the harmonic force constants are calculated using a model potential "
"(e.g., classical FF) where the interaction becomes zero beyond a certain "
"cutoff radius, the default value of ``FC_ZERO_THR`` may raise a warning "
"when creating a renormalized harmonic force constant file using "
